        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short experience about escaping dirty trousers. It can happen to anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game was made solely to get the player some laughs and to show to friends for amusement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You return to an arranged escape room in your home. After eating spicy food, your battle against time begins. Unfortunately the final goal is the bathroom behind a door with multiple locks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first person escape room style game with a time limit. Explore your surroundings and find the tools or clues to proceed.</p>",
